              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Respond with one concise, professional sentence stating that inventory valuation information cannot be displayed because the required costing context was not provided or is incomplete. Ask the user to select a cost organization, cost book, and period, then try again. Do not include technical details."
            }
